The trigaserver package ships two systemd units, both enabled and
started on install:

  trigaserver.service
    Data acquisition daemon. Reads /etc/trigaserver.conf.

  trigaserver-doc.service
    Dedicated Apache instance (apache2-bin) serving the Sphinx HTML
    manual on port 8080.

    http://localhost:8080/
    Config: /etc/trigaserver/apache-doc.conf
    Logs:   /var/log/trigaserver-doc/

This documentation server does not start Debian's apache2.service and
does not bind port 80.
